-- The Horde gunship that patrols above Icecrown (transport 192241, map 622) flew empty: its crew and quest givers
-- (Sky-Reaver Korm Blackscar, Chief Engineer Copperclaw, Koltira Deathweaver, Utamu, Brother Keltan, Warbringer Davos
-- Rioht) had no spawn, so the Orgrim's Hammer quest chain could not be taken or handed in. Passengers are `creature`
-- rows on the transport's own map (`gameobject_template`.`Data6` = 622); the position is the offset on the deck.
-- Rows and offsets from the 5.4.8 data, which matches the 3.3.5 spawns (a second Brother Keltan beside the helm is
-- left out, the 3.3.5 data has one).

DELETE FROM `creature_addon` WHERE `guid` BETWEEN 9257600 AND 9257654;
DELETE FROM `creature` WHERE `guid` BETWEEN 9257600 AND 9257654;

